al  episode her name is a nod to Dorothy  Gale from The Wizard of Oz and she even  wears the same clothing in pigtails  Dorothy does at the very end the  ape-like face would also work with her  mother being an ancient hairy godlike  woman but unlike the comics it appears  this Dorothy spinner has far greater  powers when mr. nobody is confronted by  Niles he says that the girl is quote an  adorable chip off the old block and that  she was the woman who enlarged Ezekiel  and Admiral whiskers in episode 10 we  also see that when the beard hunter  found Dorothy he was attacked by the  same monster oh yay was someone more  than a century earlier so it's likely  whatever powers oye WA had had been  transferred to the daughter in the  comics Dorothy later becomes a member of  the Doom Patrol and this might happen in  the show as well it will be interesting  to see if season two will pick up right  after the events of season one or a few  years later when Dorothy is older and  better able to harness her powers this  leaves us with what is next for Doom  Patrol will they remain together or go  back to their separate ways yes they did  save Dorothy but will their hatred for  Niles keep them apart my guess is that  with mr. nobody still in the picture  pardon the pun something will bring our  Patrol back together this show was a  totally fun ride and the best DC comic  adaptation I've seen yet and here's  hoping for a season two thanks for  watching everyone please make sure to  LIKE and subscribe and give me your  thoughts on the season below you can  also follow me on Twitter at pings story  YT I'll be coming out with more videos  so stay tuned and remember daddy loves  you very much

